# Vendored third-party source (#1506) must be tracked verbatim so a fresh
# checkout builds the exact image upstream's own remote build context did.
# The repo-root .gitignore's build-artifact rules would otherwise silently
# drop upstream-COMMITTED files from this snapshot -- notably the
# wwwroot/lib/signalr/dist/ SignalR browser client (root rule "dist/"),
# which Dockerfile-api COPYs wholesale. Re-include everything under this
# vendored tree; real build artifacts were already excluded at vendoring
# time (see .dockerignore / VENDORED.md), so there's nothing here that
# shouldn't be tracked.
!/**/
!/**
